  "religion": {
    "_note": "Deity-names are phoneme-morphs of the canonical (Agrippan) pantheon through Celtiberian phonology (-os/-anno/-oc/-onos endings, hard c) — recognizably the same powers, never real Iberian gods. Neutral clans are ancestor-venerators (saints primary); Chaotic invoke the chaos-powers.",
    "the_one": "Aiternos (< Aeternus; the high maker; seldom petitioned)",
